{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1790979186764,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#050505\", \"#FF007F\", \"#B87333\", \"#00F0FF\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A striking abstract 2D composition featuring electric magenta strokes slicing through a stark black base with a razor-thin metallic copper geometric accent.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"One detached round artificial nail tip against a solid neutral studio background. The base color is pitch black #050505 with a high-gloss finish. A bold electric magenta #FF007F watercolor bleed starts from the left sidewall. Crossing diagonally through the center is a razor-thin metallic copper #B87333 geometric line, perfectly straight. At coordinates x=50, y=45, a sharp magenta sparkle motif sits as the focal point. Studio softbox lighting creating a sharp specular highlight along the center axis, zero skin or fingers.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Void\", \"pattern\": \"abstract\", \"shape\": \"round\", \"tags\": [\"calm\", \"bold\", \"minimal\", \"maximal\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
