{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791067335114,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#8A2BE2\", \"#7FFF00\", \"#FF4500\", \"#111111\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A daring fusion of electric violet aura glow and harsh geometric chartreuse linework, flat-rendered with a split-complementary punch.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"One detached single coffin-ballerina nail tip centered against a neutral background. The base features an electric violet aura glow fading into a sharp chartreuse gradient. A stark black geometric line cuts diagonally across the center at 45 degrees. A single neon coral star is precisely placed at x:50, y:40 with a size of 6, rotated 12 degrees. Clean 2D flat graphic style with no 3D elements, no hand, and crisp studio lighting highlighting the high-gloss flat finish.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Brutalism\", \"pattern\": \"aura\", \"shape\": \"coffin_ballerina\", \"tags\": [\"calm\", \"bold\", \"minimal\", \"maximal\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
