{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791067482501,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#4A2E59\", \"#D4FF00\", \"#B87333\", \"#FF007F\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"An avant-garde clash of acid chartreuse and bruised violet, fractured by razor-thin metallic copper geometric lines and a floating neon aura glow.\", \"finish\": \"matte_overlay\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached almond-shaped artificial nail tip displayed flat on a stark neutral surface. The base features a striking split-complementary color scheme: half bruised violet matte overlay (#4A2E59) and half acid chartreuse gloss (#D4FF00). A precise metallic copper geometric line (#B87333) slices diagonally across the center. An aura glow in electric magenta (#FF007F) radiates softly from the lower third. Crisp lighting highlights the sharp 2D graphic contrast and flat texture play. Absolutely no hand, fingers, skin, or people.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Brutalism\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"almond\", \"tags\": [\"calm\", \"bold\", \"minimal\", \"maximal\"], \"texture\": \"matte\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
