{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791068344041,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#1a0b2e\", \"#b5ff36\", \"#ff2a85\", \"#00ffff\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A daring lipstick-shaped nail featuring a split-complementary color palette of electric acid lime and deep violet, sliced by razor-sharp geometric chrome lines.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached lipstick-shaped false nail tip floating against a solid neutral studio backdrop. The base color is deep violet with a high-gloss finish. A sharp, diagonal geometric stripe of electric acid lime cuts across the center, overlaid with thin silver metallic foil lines. A vibrant hot pink aura glow emanates from the lower left corner. Crisp 2D flat graphic art, studio lighting, hyper-detailed, no hand, no skin, no fingers.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Surrealist Eclipse\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"lipstick\", \"tags\": [\"calm\", \"bold\", \"minimal\", \"maximal\", \"romantic\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
