{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791068380485,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#2A1A40\", \"#CCFF00\", \"#FF007F\", \"#D1D5DB\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A striking avant-garde collision of acid chartreuse and midnight violet, split by razor-sharp geometric linework and molten metallic foil veins.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached round artificial nail tip displaying a bold 2D flat design. The base features a stark split-complementary gradient from midnight violet #2A1A40 to acid chartreuse #CCFF00. A sharp, razor-thin metallic silver geometric line #D1D5DB cuts diagonally across the center at a 30-degree angle. Positioned precisely at coordinates x=50, y=40, a vibrant spark motif in electric magenta #FF007F acts as the primary focal point, scaled to size 6. Against a high-gloss finish, fine watercolor bleeds create depth without any 3D dimension. Studio lighting, macro photography of a single nail, pure white background.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [], \"name\": \"Neon Void\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"round\", \"tags\": [\"calm\", \"bold\", \"minimal\", \"maximal\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
