{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791070820854,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#556B2F\", \"#FF6F59\", \"#00F5D4\", \"#111111\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A daring fusion of sharp geometric neon accents and calming olive aura gradients on an almond canvas.\", \"finish\": \"matte\", \"imagePrompt\": \"One detached single almond nail tip with a matte olive base. A vivid neon coral abstract geometric stripe runs diagonally from lower left at x28 y90 to upper right at x72 y24. A soft electric blue aura glow radiates from x50 y50, measuring 8.5 in size. Sharp black linework intersects at x40 y60. Flat 2D vector style, studio lighting, zero dimension, no fingers.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Brutalism\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"almond\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\"], \"texture\": \"matte\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
