{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791071384343,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#121212\", \"#D4FF00\", \"#8A2BE2\", \"#B87333\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"A striking round avant-garde nail featuring a split-complementary neon palette, sharp geometric blocking, and moody watercolor bleeds.\", \"finish\": \"matte\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached round artificial nail tip against a stark white background. Base color is deep matte charcoal #121212. Across the upper cuticle, a razor-thin neon chartreuse #D4FF00 micro-french tip. Centered at coordinate x:50 y:48, a sharp electric violet #8A2BE2 geometric star motif spanning size 8. Intersecting fine metallic copper #B87333 linework sweeps diagonally from bottom-left to top-right. Soft matte finish throughout with crisp edge definition. No hands, no skin, purely a flat digital nail art display.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Void\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"round\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\"], \"texture\": \"matte\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
