{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791071399827,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#556B2F\", \"#8A2BE2\", \"#FF6F61\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"An avant-garde square nail featuring a split-complementary neon palette with sharp geometric lines and soft watercolor floral bleeds.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached square artificial nail tip featuring a bold 2D flat design. The base is split diagonally, one side a matte olive green #556B2F, the other a glossy electric violet #8A2BE2. A razor-sharp neon coral #FF6F61 geometric line slices across the center. A watercolor floral motif is centered at x:50 y:60, size:8, in #FF6F61. A micro sparkle sits at x:30 y:30, size:3, in #556B2F. Diffuse studio lighting, perfectly flat 2D vector art style, solid neutral background.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Botanica\", \"pattern\": \"abstract\", \"shape\": \"square\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\", \"romantic\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
