{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791078319837,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#C5B9E3\", \"#39FF14\", \"#C0C0C0\", \"#2C2C54\"], \"complexity\": \"medium\", \"description\": \"An avant-garde clash of calming lavender fields and hyper-vibrant neon lime, sliced through with razor-sharp geometric linework and a molten chrome accent strip.\", \"finish\": \"matte_overlay\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached oval artificial nail tip. Base color soft matte lavender #C5B9E3. Finish is a striking contrast of velvet matte overlay with hyper-glossy neon lime #39FF14 geometric lines. At x:50 y:30, a sharp metallic silver chrome stripe sweeps diagonally across the nail. At x:50 y:70, a small minimalist neon lime sparkle of size 4. Flat 2D vector style art, crisp edges, soft studio lighting reflecting off the metallic and glossy bands. No hands, no fingers.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Serenity\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"oval\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\", \"romantic\"], \"texture\": \"matte\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
