{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791084174736,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#CEFF00\", \"#2B1135\", \"#FF007F\", \"#E0E0E0\"], \"complexity\": \"complex\", \"description\": \"A striking round nail featuring acid chartreuse and deep eggplant split-complementary contrast, slashed with hyper-gloss metallic foil geometric lines.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached round artificial nail tip against a neutral solid background. The base uses a split-complementary color scheme of acid chartreuse #CEFF00 and deep eggplant #2B1135 in a sharp geometric blocking pattern. One fine metallic silver #E0E0E0 foil strip slashes diagonally across the center at x=50, y=50. A minimalist neon magenta #FF007F star is positioned strictly at x=50, y=30 with a size of 8. The finish is high-gloss with flat 2D graphic precision, sharp edges, and studio lighting reflecting evenly.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Cyanide\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"round\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
