{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791084236130,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#1A1A1E\", \"#FF007F\", \"#BFFF00\", \"#FFFFFF\"], \"complexity\": \"complex\", \"description\": \"A daring fusion of romantic filigree and electric color theory, featuring sharp geometric contrast on a striking coffin silhouette.\", \"finish\": \"matte\", \"imagePrompt\": \"One detached single coffin-ballerina nail tip. Base color is deep matte charcoal #1A1A1E. A vivid neon pink #FF007F aura glow centers the lower nail. Precise white lace filigree #FFFFFF spans the tip in a dramatic French contrast angle. A single sharp chartreuse #BFFF00 geometric stripe cuts diagonally across the center. Flat 2D graphic art style, perfectly sharp linework, studio edge lighting, pure white background, no fingers, no hand.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Baroque Serenade\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"coffin_ballerina\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\", \"romantic\"], \"texture\": \"matte\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
