{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1791084464095,"level":"log","data":["[Mobile NOTD] generateNailOfTheDay resolved","{\"design\": {\"colors\": [\"#FF6F61\", \"#008080\", \"#C0C0C0\", \"#FFF066\"], \"complexity\": \"complex\", \"description\": \"A striking avant-garde squoval nail featuring split-complementary neon coral and electric teal with brutalist geometric linework and holographic foil accents.\", \"finish\": \"glossy\", \"imagePrompt\": \"A single detached squoval artificial nail tip displayed flat against a neutral dark grey studio background. The base features a split-complementary color scheme of electric teal #008080 and neon coral #FF6F61 with a high-gloss finish. A sharp metallic silver #C0C0C0 geometric line cuts diagonally across the center at a 45-degree angle. Positioned precisely at the upper focal point (x: 50, y: 30) is a bold teal star motif (size 8.5). Near the lower right (x: 75, y: 70), a micro sparkle accent in soft yellow #FFF066 (size 4.0). Studio lighting with sharp highlights and crisp shadows. No hand, no skin, purely the nail object.\", \"layers\": [[Object], [Object]], \"motifs\": [[Object], [Object], [Object]], \"name\": \"Neon Brutalism\", \"pattern\": \"geometric\", \"shape\": \"squoval\", \"tags\": [\"bold\", \"calm\", \"maximal\", \"minimal\"], \"texture\": \"gloss\"}, \"nailImageUrl\": null}"]}
